# Skills that stay in ~/.claude/skills and are therefore advertised in every
# directory, including non-Meta trees such as ~/repos/*.
#
# Everything else in agent_config/skills/ — including all of
# meta-powertools-vendored/ — is linked only into ~/checkoutN/.claude/skills and
# is advertised only while cwd is inside a Meta checkout. See sync.sh.
#
# Add a name here only if the skill is genuinely useful outside a Meta checkout;
# each entry costs a line of context in every unrelated session.

neovim-meta
omnigent-sessions
personal-development-setup-and-env
screenshot-workflow
